"Copperbacks drink at the Stillpool at midmorning and late afternoon; following them leads to it."
"A dead contestant of another world lies in a thornvine thicket north of the game trail, long bones only."
"Among the bones in the thicket is an iron knife, its blade sound, its grip rotted away."
"Ghostberry bushes grow along the game trail; their pale berries bring hours of retching."
"A mire monitor pair lies up in the reeds where the game trail meets the Glassrun."
